---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

import donateImage from "../assets/donate.jpg";
---

<Layout title="Donate" img={donateImage} alt="SBSB performing on stage">
  <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-start gap-5">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 justify-items-center gap-5">
      <div
        class="flex flex-col justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#00000066] px-20 py-5 text-lg backdrop-blur-xl"
      >
        <p class="text-xl font-bold">Our Mission</p>
        <p>
          Every year, we have the opportunity to spread the love and joy of
          Christ in and beyond Duke’s campus by hosting concerts and informal
          performances, singing at off-campus gigs, and producing albums. It has
          been such a joy for us to share our experiences and journeys with
          others, and we could not do any of this without the support of our
          friends, families, and supporters. We would be honored for you to
          partner with us prayerfully and financially and, in doing so, see the
          message of the hope we have in Christ reach far beyond the corners of
          this campus.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div
        class="rounded-2xl bg-[#00000066] px-20 py-5 text-lg backdrop-blur-xl"
      >
        <p class="text-xl font-bold">Checks</p>
        <p>
          Make it out to "Something Borrowed Something Blue" and send it to the
          address below. Thank you for your support!
        </p>
        <br />
        <p>The Lord bless you and keep you!</p>
        <br />
        <p>
          Something Borrowed Something Blue<br /> 407 Towerview Road<br /> PO Box
          95592<br />Durham, NC 27710
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
